---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');

const demos = [
  { id: 'basic-strokes',    title: 'Basic strokes',    dir: 'strokes' },
  { id: 'brush-strokes',    title: 'Brush strokes',    dir: 'brush-strokes' },
];
---

<PageLayout title="Basic Stroke" slug="basic-stroke">
  <div class="monologue">
    On this page, we build a basic stroke class that turns a path and a width into drawable geometry, along with a few simple variations.
    <div class="jp">このページでは、パスと線幅から描画用の形状を作る基本的なストローククラスと、そのシンプルなバリエーションをいくつか作ります。</div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>Every demo below draws the same path at the same three positions, so the only difference is how the strokes are rendered.</p>
    <div class="jp">以下のデモでは、どれも同じパスを同じ3か所に描画しています。違うのは、ストロークの描画方法だけです。</div>
  </div>

  <section class="demo-section" id="basic-strokes">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Basic strokes</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/${demos[0].dir}/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/${demos[0].dir}/index.html?embedded`} title="Basic strokes" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>A flat ribbon along the path, filled with one color and closed at both ends by a cap. This is the shape every other renderer starts from.</p>
      <div class="jp">パスに沿って帯状の形を作り、単色で塗りつぶして両端をキャップで閉じます。他のすべての描画方式も、この形をベースにしています。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="brush-strokes">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Brush strokes</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/${demos[1].dir}/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/${demos[1].dir}/index.html?embedded`} title="Brush strokes" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The same ribbon, shaded per pixel as bristles rather than filled. Each stroke carries two pigments instead of one.</p>
      <div class="jp">同じ帯状の形を単色で塗りつぶす代わりに、ピクセルごとに陰影をつけて筆の毛の筋を表現します。各ストロークには、1色ではなく2色の顔料を使います。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="dry-brush">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Dry brush</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/dry-brush-strokes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/dry-brush-strokes/index.html?embedded`} title="Dry brush" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>A stiff, dragged brush that catches on the paper's tooth and breaks into grain. The three rows are fine, medium, and coarse grain from top to bottom, at increasing tooth scale.</p>
      <div class="jp">硬い筆を引きずるように動かし、紙の凹凸に引っかかって粒状にかすれる筆跡を表現します。3つの段は、上から順に細目、中目、粗目に対応し、紙の凹凸のスケールが大きくなっています。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="shadow-strokes">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Shadow strokes</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/shadow-strokes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/shadow-strokes/index.html?embedded`} title="Shadow strokes" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Effects around the mark: a drop shadow, a debossed bevel, and a glow from top to bottom.</p>
      <div class="jp">筆跡のまわりに加える効果です。上から順に、ドロップシャドウ、縁に傾斜をつけたくぼみの表現、グロー（光彩）です。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="try">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Try drawing</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/try-strokes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed" data-w="860" data-h="620" style="width:860px;height:620px">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/try-strokes/index.html?embedded`} title="Try drawing" scrolling="no" style="width:860px;height:620px"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Try these strokes in the drawing tool.</p>
      <div class="jp">描画ツールで、このページのストロークを試してみましょう。</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
